# The sibling of the keep-the-token scenario: Devastating Onslaught for X=1 copies Thalia, Guardian of Thraben, the legend rule
# (CR 704.5j) has Bot1 choose, and Bot1 keeps the ORIGINAL: the token is put into the graveyard and ceases to exist, and Thalia
# stays on the battlefield. Nothing is left to sacrifice at the end step; Thalia is still there and nothing of hers is in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Thalia, Guardian of Thraben
Devastating Onslaught
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

